Suddenly, I hear a loud sound.
It is loud thunder.
Right then, heavy rain falls.
I do not have my umbrella with me.
The umbrella is at home.
I run quickly to the bus stop.
I stand under the roof there.
The rain is very heavy.
More rain will fall.
I stand watching the rain.
The weather is completely different now.
There is no sunlight now.
It is not hot at all.
The wind is very cold.
I stand there waiting for the bus.
